{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4965c8fcd67d1368efe23802a6264b7eb0d51d51c101bbb06828b24a2e05b1de", "ja": "クリスマス公演を間近に控えて、\n準備にいそしむアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "那是圣诞公演即将到来，\n偶像们为此勤奋做准备的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
