{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "27800af9a9dc6e5317192c063d85be12143ab2975714af88fec5a4f1f7e62b7f", "ja": "えっと～……うん、ばっちりだよ！\n私はどうかな？　色っぽいかな～？　えへ♪", "zh": "我看看……嗯，很完美！\n那我怎么样？有没有很性感～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "e5d27553bdf1ea88a505f0e877b7319d7f55d616e759a44a206810e248788bb8", "ja": "そうね……。おかしなところはなさそう。\n……色っぽくはないと思うけど。", "zh": "这个嘛……应该没有什么特别奇怪的地方。\n……我是觉得不怎么性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd4de03e57abc07ccce7bbc3a1359799078c5394dc9e15117db416e2dcecfe51", "ja": "よかった～！　……あれっ？", "zh": "太好了……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e9fb081d584765e2921e0dbb0bf38ca4659f10f0b2f2d1ba3a9612df6fe3c5c0", "ja": "二人とも、そろそろ時間だけど、\n準備はできてるか？", "zh": "两位，时间差不多了，\n你们准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "965d273f5d8f5022295ef4997e77704407f6b5d853237f4629b52009ae9afba1", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nやれるだけのことは、やったつもりですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n我自认已经做好最万全的准备了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "0fa0a22514e7dd5aed23619fcaa0c9ffcba5078d8161d8cfb80d68f99c5211f0", "ja": "可奈は準備万端～♪　エネルギーまんたんで～す♪", "zh": "可奈准备好了～♪电充得满满的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "3c86155967c45903baf2ce75453c3e27483e8361a565684af8bf31bf2a9498eb", "ja": "はぁ……。よく笑っていられるわね。\nレッスンでは一度もできてないのに。", "zh": "唉……你怎么还笑得出来啊。\n明明在训练时一次都没有成功过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "e36db2adcad3287de12ff4e901b3f61f300f4c437a0e3bb93b85e453a41efc97", "ja": "私たちが歌うのは、春香さん達の歌。\n中途半端なデキだと、アラが目立つだけよ。", "zh": "我们要演唱的是春香她们的歌。\n如果表现得不够完美，只会更加突显缺点而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "05f7b23c4d72751480338f50bb541b089b81d255dbb3972226c0c4ffd27837d3", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、志保ちゃん！\n今日は絶対に、うまくいく気がするんだ～。", "zh": "没问题啦，志保！\n我觉得今天一定能够顺利唱好的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3791dde5179b8b83ab746a9e79c5ed2f41a80e5ceb75d4dd25f79cd6981807d4", "ja": "はは、いいぞ、可奈。\nその調子で、自信をもって行こう！", "zh": "哈哈，很好，可奈。\n就照这个步调，带着自信上台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "7fb372bfc5885c8423151c9200a7cb33eb6f3c078c988e8b06d7c631a1d76a51", "ja": "はいっ、がんばります♪", "zh": "好！我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "1d153f4b3b0828cdb7f2b6ec932deccdf6462ed27e758fc26838e91be0121836", "ja": "大丈夫かしら……。\nとにかく、できる限り合わせましょう。", "zh": "真的没问题吗……\n总之，我也会尽量配合可奈的步调。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "c4658bb2483cc1a1e8402dd14b5495b495724799bed6db5548a8dc69c37fc449", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}さん。\nいってきます。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生。\n我上场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "910da2bd9265a58ec2b436a96fb22455d917c0411b275b429b25610ef7f81ecc", "ja": "私も、いってきますね！", "zh": "我也要上场啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "79cba8f834e70daaf72b6e26a7494622487ad1d58e4743e59c4b32414248654c", "ja": "お疲れさま！　ハーモニーも綺麗だったし、\n二人ともバッチリだったんじゃないか？", "zh": "辛苦你们了！不仅和声漂亮，\n两个人的表现都很完美呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0e764c6123239238711747d2842a3a8f74646b27db41408cca9958e89498588", "ja": "そうですよね？　私、ちゃんとできてましたよね？\nわーい、大成功♪", "zh": "没错吧？我表现得很棒对不对？\n耶～超成功♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "5b4506bcff5003775c2e03a07e8c3ba5385977dc2b38515cd59ba36ba2f21a89", "ja": "本当に……完ぺきだったわ。\n可奈、急にどうしたの？", "zh": "真的……很完美呢。\n可奈，你怎么突然就会了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4d23e2749e9c4aaad13da3e70f54052ad627cabaa55006137c82f9b51d5f85f", "ja": "えへへっ！\nじつはナイショで特訓してたんだ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿！\n其实我有偷偷进行特训喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "35d8d0ffc84c22cb929097362583b0b61ee4624ab8f22b0fe321899624cc9224", "ja": "ああっ、ナイショなのに言っちゃった！\nど、どうしましょう、{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "啊啊！不小心把秘密说出来了！\n怎、怎么办啊，{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "aae707201a3c6aa543115c39351916d44966a8b93354b228f652a1bb92291672", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。\nもう、どうしようもないかな？", "zh": "这、这个嘛……\n也不能怎么办了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "9d1abb0e1292ec6d1d62140d5b2b9218d4da9d2f6753203a837f23e5c7f02084", "ja": "はうっ！？　そ、そんな～。", "zh": "啊呜！？怎、怎么会～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "dd1142c5bed993de7f3ea41e585ec7d6cbf50032e40dfee43ca6368d04e54810", "ja": "……。\n{$P$}さんは、知ってたんですか？", "zh": "……\n{$P$}先生早就知情了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f848c6230a6e589f09e7a40cb01ca1ff54320184937811a3dc65bf6746d7531f", "ja": "まあ、ひとりで居残りはさせられないから。\n可奈は昨日も、遅くまで残って頑張ってたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟我不能让她一个人留在剧场。\n可奈昨天也一直努力到很晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "c6f979f2586a81680d27090744b71d7dfe4c2cf85e578c503feee9afe4359f32", "ja": "遅くまで……。", "zh": "很晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "c5e71ef6304a6bed60f8c4ab21b81c537ff1c5d60c89730ace7f0ba2ec00dc4e", "ja": "ご、ごめんね志保ちゃん！　私だけできないとこ、\nたくさんあったから。それで私だけ……。", "zh": "对、对不起，志保！\n因为有好多地方只有我学不会，所以我才会一个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "c7d47859e475df8c2142fabfbf9dec6f6809d6387cced59ba9902eff845144d4", "ja": "別に、謝ることないでしょ。\nちゃんとできたんだから。", "zh": "这没什么好道歉的吧？\n因为你表现得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "f3b2a944bc263c2d1e9d28523489d7c93aee4c779c194a48d2df7c6c8c6648dd", "ja": "リズムもピッタリだったし。おかげで今日は、\nとっても……気持ちよく歌えたかも。", "zh": "节奏也抓得很准，多亏了你，\n我今天……感觉唱得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbe6d335a89ef9c24baffe2d9d035a940e2e9e77e0d2fd68783fd0d388859a44", "ja": "えっ、ホントに！？", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "4c02ba87517cc94c1b8e33c0c567192500842ceb023a6d3d3bc0398405837b5c", "ja": "でも、今日できたからって、本番で失敗したら\n意味ないわよ。気を抜かないで。", "zh": "不过，即使今天成功，如果在正式上场时失败\n就没有意义了，所以不可以掉以轻心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "a116cc8c52378bd4acefa7df1cf16d93f9ac67409749d65c419e8c3f8e747ca2", "ja": "うんっ、大丈夫だよ～たぶん！\nえへへ、練習の成果～、うれちいな～♪", "zh": "嗯，没问题的～大概！\n嘿嘿，练习的成果～好开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "6c2215cf69df3e738b104dbce5c04cd206c10e4831922e7950a4b28d97d6f37c", "ja": "また、すぐ調子にのる……。", "zh": "又来了，马上就得意忘形……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "2390a51f523221edaaad26a541a3bad2d94d5bdc8874da41653f2a986fee8ecc", "ja": "あ、もうこんな時間！　志保ちゃん、今日も\n保育園にお迎えだよね？　まだ平気なの？", "zh": "啊，已经这么晚了！\n志保，你要去幼儿园接弟弟了吧？还不用出发吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "5f0987b19e20b185fa7e48e7747a912c5b6ffc6b0f1a6f5342ce7070950b34e0", "ja": "そうね、そろそろ……。\nあの、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "说得也是，时间差不多了……\n那个，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "5cbff80d2a7cbef809613a8175e8e42108bb0eaf89248a958f0eac81209f1c73", "ja": "可奈のレッスン……、私たちのレッスンに付き合って\nくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "谢谢你陪可奈……\n陪我们上训练课程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e4323a453e46704c9b4f74e12b587f256fd26d9c4b96e6cc5e32c3b1b354bf20", "ja": "別に、お礼を言われることじゃないよ。\n本番の公演、楽しみにしてるぞ。", "zh": "这不是什么大事，用不着道谢啦。\n我很期待正式公演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "27db274060eab32e74a37f63b33ee2f5d6d90e637e821b136e74f78b6cf72583", "ja": "はい。必ず、成功させて見せます。\nそれから、可奈も……。", "zh": "好，我们一定会让公演成功的。\n还有，可奈你也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "2bc1fc8c4d77916922cfc12505ca9f881a7259441702345a86dca85a6f255d2f", "ja": "えっ。なになに？", "zh": "咦，什么什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "ba721fd2c04955cd6112b0c5bbd483645f3385b7fec8336eee66194403636db4", "ja": "いつまでも浮かれてないで、しっかり復習しておいて。\n今日の感覚を忘れないように。", "zh": "你别一直陶醉在一时的成功里，要好好复习。\n不能忘记今天的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "9d1e777031eec307862dd04b391a82474416d09b49ebb5dfd33ec75f1e61fcca", "ja": "あう。そ、そうだよね～。\nガンバリマス……。", "zh": "啊呜，说、说得也是～\n我会加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "d4ba83c410b71cf5da6976dab21365a741b2d5e89734c36406d73d7c9ebc20a9", "ja": "私も、ちゃんと頑張るわ。……一緒に。", "zh": "我也会好好努力的……两个人一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "481e4d4073824365613744e40557f45c16d40bfcd7b66aeea1183dd5aea47571", "ja": "それじゃ、お先に失礼します。\n可奈も着替えるんでしょ？　行きましょう。", "zh": "那么我就先告辞了。\n可奈你也要换衣服不是吗？走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_008_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_008_fc_01_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "fef0feaf76eb6e4316bb5430015ae6327df39a1ee9a1d79d779142b1b6bca507", "ja": "あ、うんっ！　{$P$}さん、\nお先に失礼します！　着替えも一緒に～、ゴ～ゴゴ～♪", "zh": "啊，嗯！{$P$}先生，我们先走了！\n换衣服也一起～GO～GOGO～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
